Rips_CreateStake
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert.
├── when ticket cap is not a power of two
│   └── it should revert.
├── when tiers is empty
│   └── it should revert.
├── when tiers exceeds max tier count
│   └── it should revert.
├── when a tier has min prize greater than max prize
│   └── it should revert.
├── when tiers are not sorted by count descending
│   └── it should revert.
├── when total prize count does not equal ticket cap
│   └── it should revert.
├── when total prize pool does not equal ticket cap times ticket cost
│   └── it should revert.
├── when fee percent exceeds FEE_BASE
│   └── it should revert.
└── when fee percent is at most FEE_BASE
    ├── it should store the stake configuration.
    ├── it should increment the next stake ID.
    └── it should emit a {StakeCreated} event.
